@startuml
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
title ClassroomQuiz - Logical Components
actor Teacher
actor Student
component "Teacher Browser" as TB
component "Student Browser" as SB
package "Local Backend" {
 component "Role / Session Validation" as Auth
 component "Activity Management\nWAITING / ANSWERING / RESULTS / COMPLETED" as Activity
 component "Submission Management\nServer receive order / one per group-question" as Quiz
 component "Guided Notes Import / Export\nValidate placeholders / preserve workbook" as Notes
 component "State Synchronization\nRole-filtered views / reconnect" as Sync
 database "Runtime Activity Store\nOriginal workbook + mappings\nSessions / groups / questions / submissions" as Store
}
Teacher --> TB
Student --> SB
TB --> Auth : password / privileged operations
SB --> Auth : claim group / resume identity
Auth --> Activity : teacher commands / authorized views
Auth --> Quiz : validated student submission
Auth --> Notes : teacher-only import / export
Activity --> Quiz : open / close in same processing order
Activity --> Store
Quiz --> Store
Notes --> Store : atomic import / export snapshot
Activity --> Sync : phase / question changes
Quiz --> Sync : accepted submission
Sync --> Store : current authoritative state
Sync --> TB : all submissions + status + rank\nteacher-only global stateRevision
Sync --> SB : phase + question + own status + studentViewRevision\nno event for another group's submission\nall accepted answers / ranks only after close
TB --> Notes : .xlsx downloaded from Google Sheets
Notes --> TB : .xlsx copy with closed-question winners
note bottom of Store
 Retained during backend lifetime; restart may clear.
 No public cloud deployment or direct Sheets integration.
end note
note bottom of Notes
 Export never changes activity state.
 .xlsx acceptability and placeholder permission:
 external confirmation pending (OI-001 / OI-002).
end note
@enduml
